              "type": "depends_on",
              "evidence": "This is a proposal for a URI scheme to be used in the Proof of Payment\nprocess.",
              "reason": "The URI scheme exists to initiate and transport requests for the Proof of Payment process defined by BIP 120; the proposal's reference list explicitly identifies BIP 120 as “Proof of Payment.”",
